#: app/web/anwendung.js:16421
msgid "App password"
msgstr "App-passord"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16424
msgid ""
"Only HTTPS. Create an app password in Nextcloud under Settings, Security. "
"Your account password is never used."
msgstr ""
"Kun HTTPS. Opprett et app-passord i Nextcloud under Innstillinger, "
"Sikkerhet. Kontopassordet ditt brukes aldri."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16443
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Test forbindelsen"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16447 app/web/anwendung.js:16449
msgid "Delete password"
msgstr "Slett passord"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16448
msgid ""
"Delete the stored app password? The mailbox can no longer deliver until a "
"new one is entered."
msgstr ""
"Slette det lagrede app-passordet? Postkassen kan ikke levere før et nytt er "
"lagt inn."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16478
msgid ""
"A fallback for branch baum-1: when the direct connection cannot be reached, "
"messages travel through a WebDAV folder on your Nextcloud server."
msgstr ""
"En reserveløsning for grenen baum-1: Hvis den direkte forbindelsen ikke kan "
"nås, går meldinger gjennom en WebDAV-mappe på Nextcloud-serveren din."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16482
msgid ""
"This is only the encrypted Magnolienbaum fallback for baum-1. It does not "
"synchronize calendars or contacts. Both partners need access to the same "
"Nextcloud storage."
msgstr ""
"Dette er bare den krypterte Magnolienbaum-reserveveien for baum-1. Den "
"synkroniserer ikke kalendere eller kontakter. Begge parter må ha tilgang til "
"det samme Nextcloud-lageret."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16491
msgid "Use the mailbox as a fallback for branch baum-1"
msgstr "Bruk postkassen som reserve for grenen baum-1"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16493
msgid ""
"The server operator can see the account, folder and file names, sizes and "
"times of your messages."
msgstr ""
"Serveroperatøren kan se konto, mappe- og filnavn, størrelser og tidspunkter "
"for meldingene dine."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16498
msgid "Magnolie Notes phone connection"
msgstr "Magnolie Notes telefontilkobling"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16499
msgid ""
"A separate encrypted connection for dial requests, device status and "
"selected notifications."
msgstr ""
"En separat kryptert tilkobling for oppringingsforespørsler, enhetsstatus og "
"utvalgte varsler."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16500
msgid "KDE Connect for SMS"
msgstr "KDE Connect for sending av SMS"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16501
msgid ""
"KDE Connect is used only for SMS. It does not connect or synchronize the "
"Magnolienbaum."
msgstr ""
"KDE Connect brukes kun for SMS. Den kobler ikke til eller synkroniserer "
"Magnolienbaum."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16506
msgid "The phone connection is available only in the installed application."
msgstr "Telefontilkoblingen er bare tilgjengelig i det installerte programmet."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16508
msgid "KDE Connect for SMS is available only in the installed application."
msgstr "KDE Connect for SMS er kun tilgjengelig i det installerte programmet."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16521
msgid "Enable Magnolie Notes phone connection"
msgstr "Aktiver Magnolie Notes telefontilkobling"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16525
msgid ""
"Uses its own identity and storage and listens only on fixed port %(port)s. "
"It never uses Magnolienbaum partners, permissions, queues or Bluetooth "
"identity."
msgstr ""
"Bruker sin egen identitet og lagring og lytter bare på den faste porten "
"%(port)s. Den bruker aldri Magnolienbaum-partnere, tillatelser, køer eller "
"Bluetooth-identitet."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16530
msgid ""
"Disabled: no listener, discovery, reconnect or phone tray entries are active."
msgstr ""
"Deaktivert: ingen lytter, oppdagelse, ny tilkobling eller telefonikoner i "
"systemstatusfeltet er aktive."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16532
msgid "Listener active"
msgstr "Lytter aktiv"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16532
msgid "Listener stopped"
msgstr "Lytter stoppet"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16534
msgid "WLAN listener on port %(port)s"
msgstr "WLAN-lytter på port %(port)s"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16537 app/web/anwendung.js:16680 MainForm.cs:440
msgid "Connect phone via WLAN"
msgstr "Koble til telefonen via WLAN"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16544 TelefonCoordinator.cs:82
msgid ""
"Only one Magnolie Notes phone can be paired. Remove the existing phone "
"before changing devices."
msgstr ""
"Bare én Magnolie Notes-telefon kan pares. Fjern den eksisterende telefonen "
"før du bytter enhet."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16549
msgid ""
"Multiple Magnolie Notes phones are stored. Personal sync is blocked; remove "
"all but one phone."
msgstr ""
"Flere Magnolie Notes-telefoner er lagret. Personlig synkronisering er "
"blokkert; fjern alle telefoner unntatt én."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16550
msgid "No phone paired yet."
msgstr "Ingen telefon er paret ennå."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16553
msgid "Online via WLAN"
msgstr "Tilkoblet via WLAN"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16554
msgid "Online via Bluetooth data"
msgstr "Tilkoblet via Bluetooth-data"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16563
msgid "System-paired phone Bluetooth address"
msgstr "Bluetooth-adressen til den systemparede telefonen"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16567
msgid "No system-paired Bluetooth device found"
msgstr "Finner ingen systemtilkoblet Bluetooth-enhet"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16592
msgid "Bluetooth data fallback"
msgstr "Bluetooth-data som reserve"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16594
msgid ""
"Requires existing pairing in Windows Settings under Bluetooth & devices. "
"Data only, no HFP audio."
msgstr ""
"Krever en eksisterende paring i Windows-innstillinger under Bluetooth og "
"enheter. Bare data, ingen HFP-lyd."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16603
msgid ""
"Magnolie Notes ended the session. The app and Organizer must use the same "
"protocol version."
msgstr ""
"Magnolie Notes avsluttet økten. Appen og Organizer må bruke samme "
"protokollversjon."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16604 app/web/anwendung.js:16606
msgid "Remove phone connection"
msgstr "Fjern telefontilkobling"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16605
msgid "Remove this phone connection and its queues and permissions?"
msgstr "Fjerne denne telefontilkoblingen samt køene og tillatelsene?"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16613
msgid ""
"WLAN has priority. Bluetooth data starts only after WLAN failure and carries "
"the same encrypted phone frames."
msgstr ""
"WLAN har prioritet. Bluetooth-data starter først etter WLAN-feil og "
"overfører de samme krypterte telefonrammene."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16618
msgid ""
"The KDE Connect support is built into the Organizer. Only the KDE Connect "
"app on Android is required; no additional KDE Connect desktop program is "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"KDE Connect-støtten er innebygd i Organizer. Bare KDE Connect-appen på "
"Android er nødvendig; ingen ekstra KDE Connect skrivebordsprogram er "
"nødvendig."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16619
msgid ""
"Magnolie Notes phones and KDE Connect phones are separate: the Android model "
"name belongs to Magnolie Notes; the KDE peer name comes from KDE Connect."
msgstr ""
"Magnolie Notes-telefoner og KDE Connect-telefoner er separate: Android-"
"modellnavnet tilhører Magnolie Notes; KDE-partnernavnet kommer fra KDE "
"Connect."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16621 app/web/anwendung.js:16632
#: app/web/anwendung.js:20294
msgid "KDE Connect phone paired."
msgstr "KDE Connect telefon paret."

