msgid "Renew pairing"
msgstr "Renew pairing"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16639
msgid ""
"Renew KDE Connect pairing? Only KDE trust for this phone will be removed and "
"rebuilt. Magnolie Notes, notes and chat history remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Fornye KDE Connect-paringen? Bare KDE-klareringen for denne telefonen "
"fjernes og bygges opp på nytt. Magnolie Notes, notater og samtalehistorikk "
"forblir uendret."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16648
msgid "Pair KDE Connect phone"
msgstr "Par KDE Connect-telefon"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:16650
msgid ""
"Open KDE Connect on the phone and start pairing. Compare the eight-character "
"verification key and confirm on both devices."
